The document has 776 blocks but 0 text chars. The block_type 2 (text blocks) don't seem to have text in them via this API. This is because the API returns blocks with `text.elements[].text_run.content` but my code is trying `el.get('text',{}).get('text','')` which doesn't match the actual structure.

Let me look at the actual structure more carefully. From item 1, I see the text structure is:
```json
{
  "text": {
    "elements": [
      {
        "text_run": {
          "content": "来源：",
          "text_element_style": {...}
        }
      },
      ...
    ],
    "style": {...}
  }
}
```

So the text content is inside `text_run.content`, not in `text.text`. My code was checking `el.get('text',{}).get('text','')` but it should be `el.get('text_run',{}).get('content','')`.

Let me fix the extraction.

